# Project Architecture

## Stack

- React 18
- Vite
- React Router DOM
- Tailwind CSS 3
- ESLint

## Architecture

```
pages/        → route-level screens
components/   → shared UI / layout
hooks/        → reusable hooks
data/         → site content & config
App.jsx       → routing
main.jsx      → entry
```

## Rules

Pages:

- Route screens only
- Compose shared components
- Prefer content from `src/data/` when the pattern exists

Components:

- Reusable UI only
- No route ownership

Hooks:

- Shared stateful/logic reuse only

Data:

- Site copy, nav, metadata live in `src/data/` when practical

## Naming

- camelCase variables / functions
- PascalCase components
- UPPER_CASE constants

## Async

- Prefer async/await
- No callback-style control flow for new code

## Configuration

- Never hardcode secrets
- Environment variables only for sensitive or env-specific values
- Do not commit `.env`

## Responses / side effects

- External links: `rel="noopener noreferrer"` when `target="_blank"`
- Avoid `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` unless trusted and necessary

## Folder structure

Folder structure must remain unchanged unless the user explicitly requests a restructure.

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev
npm run build
npm run lint
npm run preview
```
